<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοπολί̄τ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enjoying equal political rights</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς τοῖς Μακεδόσιν ποιήσας ἰ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				12.1.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				2.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5183.25
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Magn.</u>
				34.28
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.357
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>enjoying reciprocity of rights</i>, of the citizens of Roman
				<i>municipia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.76
			</span></i>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσοπολῑτ-πολῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίτιδος</span>, of cities <i>enjoying such rights</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἰ. πόλεις</span>,= <i>municipia</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>equitable citizen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				41.28
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii/iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
